    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">about 3 hours to read in full - use it as a lookup</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">474 reports</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">107 problems</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">61 companies</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">SDE-1 and SDE-2</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Recently Asked HLD Questions (mid-2024 to Nov 2026)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Which system design questions are companies really asking right now? We read 437 interview-experience posts from 2024-06 to 2026-11, grouped every HLD question into 107 problems and ranked them. Each problem below lists every reported variant with its company, level, date, round and source post, plus a five-line plan for answering it and a link to the full design on this site.</p>\n      "
  },
