      "id": "story",
      "title": "The story: asking the kids who already took the test",
      "chunk": "0.html",
      "bytes": 1641,
      "before": "<div class=\"callout tip\" id=\"how-to-use\"><p><b>How to use this page.</b> It is a lookup table, not something to read top to bottom. Pick one path:</p>\n        <ol>\n          <li><b>Two weeks left?</b> Do the <a href=\"#top-25\">Top 10</a> in order, one a day, timed at 45 minutes and out loud, starting with <a href=\"{{BASE}}hld/d05\">news feed</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}hld/d14\">ticket booking</a> and <a href=\"{{BASE}}hld/d03\">notifications</a>. Then open each problem's card to read how real interviewers varied it.</li>\n          <li><b>Know the company?</b> Go to its guide first (loop, level expectations, its own top 10): <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-amazon\">Amazon</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-microsoft\">Microsoft</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-google\">Google</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-meta\">Meta</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-uber\">Uber</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-atlassian\">Atlassian</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-flipkart\">Flipkart</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-walmart\">Walmart</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-salesforce\">Salesforce</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-oracle-adobe\">Oracle &amp; Adobe</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-fintech-india\">Indian fintech</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}companies/co-food-qcommerce\">Food &amp; quick-commerce</a>. Then use the <b>Company</b> filter in the <a href=\"#full-list\">full list</a>.</li>\n          <li><b>Preparing for SDE-1?</b> In the full list set <b>Topic</b> to <code>sde1</code> (or look for the <span class=\"chip\">SDE-1 friendly</span> chip) and, for each problem, draw the entities, tables and APIs first, then one scaling step.</li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>Want a day-by-day schedule? Use the <a href=\"{{BASE}}interview/study-plan\">Study Plan</a>.</p>\n      </div>"
    },
